        "TileImage": "$($repository ee2af034-8ebe-43f8-a8f3-525e060dbb31).Image",
        "Description": "Good day 47. \rYour target is Baltazar Morrison,  a terrorist disguised as a race marshall. He has been tasked by Robert Knox to place a bomb on the race car of Moses Lee. He was arrested by the festival security but due to a high-level threat of him escaping or having an accomplice, we have been tasked with his elimination. It&apos;s a high-stakes situation, so eliminate him with his own bomb, destroying it.\rEliminate all targets, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
